HighInBC wrote:
> 2. What combination of armour is best, some sort of comprimise between
> AC and special abilities of armour.

According to the spoiler, monks receive a -20 penalty to hit when 
wearing body armor, lose the weaponless to-hit bonus when wearing body 
armor or a shield, and cannot deal staggering blows when wearing body 
armor or a shield (staggering blows aren't that great anyway). In other 
words, what you wear other than body armor and shields doesn't matter. 
Eventually, you'll be able to wear body armor and still be able to hit 
every time.

